  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening National Institutional Sector Coordination  Fiduciary Capacity for GCF Accreditation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this readiness is to strengthen national capacities to access climate finance in Eswatini through creating an enabling environment and supporting two national institutions to be accredited to GCF, develop long term strategies for net zero emissions pathways, contribute to national climate action, develop pipeline projects for each of the two institutions and enhance knowledge and awareness of stakeholders on GCF and climate change</narrative>
  </description>
